{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "37", "x": 0.904017983697097, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029725264906538765, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "them authentically, whether for comedy or drama. And lastly but equally", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.7784444334742744, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "important, resilience, as rejection is constant in this field, so you really need", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.7785575184983211, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that mental toughness to keep going after failed auditions.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.6020716269059517, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Absolutely. Acting strikes me as a classic case of \"you win some, you lose", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.7784449460990435, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "more.\" The most obvious drawback is the unstable income-one moment", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.7790997729789948, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you're booked solid, and the next, you're scrambling for gigs. Then there's", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.7784665788642963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the relentless pressure to stay relevant in a cutthroat industry-constantly", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.7791834333412995, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "worrying about critics' opinions or being replaced by younger talent. Beyond", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.7786406662358568, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the spotlight, loneliness poses another significant challenge. The", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.7786829065168244, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "unpredictable nature of an actor's schedule often isolates them from family", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.7784665788642963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and disrupts daily routines. This explains why, behind the on-screen glamour,", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.7791609803764162, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "many performers grapple with profound emptiness.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.5276410735674982, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}